   "source": [
    "## 15. Recommendations"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "abfe7b90",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "### Recommended Business Actions\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Adopt margin-based discount controls:** Set discount thresholds by category/sub-category rather than applying broad discounts.\n",
    "2. **Prioritize profitable product mix:** Increase inventory and promotional attention for consistently profitable categories.\n",
    "3. **Investigate loss-making sub-categories:** Review pricing, procurement costs, returns, and discount practices before increasing promotional activity.\n",
    "4. **Replicate high-performing regional practices:** Compare pricing, customer mix, and product mix in the best region against weaker regions.\n",
    "5. **Use monthly analytics for planning:** Combine sales and profit trends with inventory and campaign planning to improve resource allocation.\n",
    "6. **Track profit KPIs, not only revenue:** Management dashboards should show sales, profit, margin, discount, and order metrics together.\n"
   ]
  },
